  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 2⁵⁷ ⁻ ³³ ÷ ¹¹ × ¹³ ⁻ ² + 3⁶⁴ ⁻ ⁵⁶ ÷ ⁸ × ⁴ ⁻ ⁴⁴ = 35\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1): 2 and 4\n\n257 - 33 ÷ 11 × 13 - 2 + 364 - 56 ÷ 8 × 4 - 44​ = 35 ⇒ 457 - 33 ÷ 11 × 13 - 4 + 364 - 56 ÷ 8 × 2 - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 457 - __**33 ÷ 11**__ × 13 - 4 + 364 - __**56 ÷ 8**__ × 2 - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 457 - __**3 × 13**__ - 4 + 364 - __**7 × 2**__ - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 4__**57 - 39 - 4**__ + 3__**64 - 14 - 44**__​ = 35\n\n⇒ __**414 + 36**__​ = 35 \n\n⇒ 268436185​ ≠ 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): 56 and 57\n\n257 - 33 ÷ 11 × 13 - 2 + 364 - 56 ÷ 8 × 4 - 44​ = 35 ⇒ 256 - 33 ÷ 11 × 13 - 2 + 364 - 57 ÷ 8 × 4 - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 256 - __33 ÷ 11__ × 13 - 2 + 364 - __**57 ÷ 8**__ × 4 - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 256 - __**3 × 13**__ - 2 + 364 - __**7.125 × 4**__ - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 2**__56 - 39 - 2__** + 3**__64 - 28.5 - 44__**​ = 35\n\n⇒ __**215 + 3-8.5**__​ = 35\n\n⇒ 32768 ≠ 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): 57 and 64\n\n257 - 33 ÷ 11 × 13 - 2 + 364 - 56 ÷ 8 × 4 - 44​ = 35 ⇒ 264 - 33 ÷ 11 × 13 - 2 + 357 - 56 ÷ 8 × 4 - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 264 - __**33 ÷ 11**__ × 13 - 2 + 357 - __**56 ÷ 8**__ × 4 - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 264 - __**3 × 13**__ - 2 + 357 - __**7 × 4**__ - 44​ = 35\n\n⇒ 2**__64 - 39 - 2__** + 3**__57 - 28 - 44__**​ = 35\n\n⇒ __**2**23** + 3**-15__​ = 35\n\n⇒ 8388608 ≠ 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): 33 and 44\n\n257 - 33 ÷ 11 × 13 - 2 + 364 - 56 ÷ 8 × 4 - 44​ = 35 ⇒ 257 - 44 ÷ 11 × 13 - 2 + 364 - 56 ÷ 8 × 4 - 33​ = 35\n\n⇒ 257 - __**44 ÷ 11**__ × 13 - 2 + 364 - __**56 ÷ 8**__ × 4 - 33​ = 35\n\n⇒ 257 - __**4 × 13**__ - 2 + 364 - __**7 × 4**__ - 33​ = 35\n\n⇒ 2**__57 - 52 - 2__** + 3**__64 - 28 - 33__**​ = 35\n\n⇒ __**23**__ + __**3**____**3**__​ = 35\n\n⇒ __**8**____** + 27**__​ = 35\n\n**⇒ 35 = 35 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.\n\n55:T4a66,\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41)",
